{"id":"636845930cfd1ccc","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-program-checker.md","title":"判定任务的黑盒程序检查器","display":"df-program-checker — 判定任务的黑盒程序检查器","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-program-checker","aliases":["28-df-program-checker"],"display":"df-program-checker — 判定任务的黑盒程序检查器","depends_on":["[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","[[28-df-oracle-tm]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 8.26","source_printed_pages":"164","source_pdf_pages":"190","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-program-checker"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-program-checker</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-program-checker — 判定任务的黑盒程序检查器"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e7207510b515565\" href=\"?note=3e7207510b515565\" title=\"28-df-oracle-tm\">28-df-oracle-tm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 8.26"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"164"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"190"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；任务 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(T\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{OTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(C^B)\">\\(L(C^B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e7207510b515565\" href=\"?note=3e7207510b515565\" title=\"28-df-oracle-tm\">28-df-oracle-tm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\\)</span> 上询问候选程序的接受语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀随机串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,B,m}(x)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{m(|x|)}}[\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\\in L(C^B)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,B,m}(x)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{m(|x|)}}[\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\\in L(C^B)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Checker}(C,T)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\\land\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\\left(\\forall n\\;m(n)=c(n+2)^b\\right)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}\\;\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r))\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,T,m}(x)\\ge\\tfrac23\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall x\\in B\\mathbin\\triangle T\\;\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,B,m}(x)&lt;\\tfrac13\\Bigr].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Checker}(C,T)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\\land\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\\left(\\forall n\\;m(n)=c(n+2)^b\\right)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}\\;\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r))\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,T,m}(x)\\ge\\tfrac23\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall x\\in B\\mathbin\\triangle T\\;\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,B,m}(x)&lt;\\tfrac13\\Bigr].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本项把书中一般字符串任务专门化为语言判定任务，候选程序按黑盒语言预言机建模。候选处处正确时要求高概率接受；只要当前x回答错误便要求低概率接受。它允许候选在别处出错而当前处正确时作任意决定，故不是整体程序等价性的判定器。查询成本按预言机模型计，未把候选内部运行时间藏入多项式保证。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 8.26；印刷 pp.164 / PDF pp.190。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；任务 $T\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{OTM}$、$L(C^B)$、$\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-tm]]。$C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}$，$m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；$C$ 在输入 $\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$ 上询问候选程序的接受语言 $B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$U_j$ 是 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀随机串；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；任务 $T\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{OTM}$、$L(C^B)$、$\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-tm]]。$C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}$，$m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；$C$ 在输入 $\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$ 上询问候选程序的接受语言 $B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$U_j$ 是 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀随机串；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OTM}","display":false},{"tex":"L(C^B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}","display":false},{"tex":"m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,B,m}(x)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{m(|x|)}}[\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\\in L(C^B)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Checker}(C,T)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&C\\in\\mathrm{OTM}\\land\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\\left(\\forall n\\;m(n)=c(n+2)^b\\right)\\\\&\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}\\;\\operatorname{time}_{C^B}(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r))\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\\\&\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,T,m}(x)\\ge\\tfrac23\\\\&\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall x\\in B\\mathbin\\triangle T\\;\\operatorname{CheckPr}_{C,B,m}(x)<\\tfrac13\\Bigr].\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2355,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]、[[28-thm-dip-equals-np]]、[[28-df-formula-arithmetization]]、[[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]]、[[28-thm-sumcheck-soundness]]、[[28-df-program-checker]]。"}],"outgoing":["0dfeff4bd5d69b86","3e7207510b515565"]}